<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL - U.S. Robotics up,.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - U.S. Robotics up,.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in U.S. Robotics shares gained 1-5/8 to 69 preceding the market open on positive analyst comments, according to traders.</p>
<p>Traders said Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette added U.S. Robotics to the firm's recommended list. The analyst was not immediately available to comment on the move.</p>
<p>Elsewhere, Phamis Inc shares are expected to trade down sharply after the healthcare-related computer hardware and software company warned late Friday of lower than expected fourth quarter results.</p>
</text>
